    whyItMatters: "CRISPR-Cas9 represents a revolution in genetic engineering — it is faster, cheaper, and more precise than previous gene-editing tools. In the HSC, it appears in discussions of biotechnology, genetic disease treatment, and the ethical implications of germline editing. It is one of the most significant scientific developments of the 21st century.",
